                "message": "🐛 Make the citar layout follow font changes and drop the missing citar-refresh\n\n- Count the frame columns from the pixel width and the character width, so a font change shows at once.\n- Remember the font with the columns, and format the cached candidates again when only the font changed, since the emoji cells are in them.\n- citar has no citar-refresh any more; it formats again by itself when the templates change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9m8fmtgNiBeMPZDGW",
